事。“哦，你说的那个啊，我也看到了，是不是戴着个奇怪面具，穿着白色衣服，看着起来弱不经风的少年？”“没错，没错，就是那个，该不会是哪家的少年看话本看疯了吧！那面具挺瘆人的，白的红的……”“听他还叫着什么鸠儿鸠儿的吧……”灵鸠一开始把他们的话当趣儿来听，可越听越不对劲，到最后她完全可以确定，他们说的那个疯子就是宋雪衣那个小鬼。“呦，快看，那疯子来了。”灵鸠还没有来得及去教训那幸灾乐祸的家伙，耳边隐约就听宋雪衣的叫声，‘鸠儿’的呼唤透过雨幕变得朦胧。她快步走到围栏边，一眼看到大雨中纤长的身影。“宋雪衣，你脑袋生锈了吗！”灵鸠拧眉大喊。雨中的身影停住了没有目标的乱转，下一刻快步朝这边跑过来。随着近了，灵鸠眉头拧得更紧。眼前的人狼狈至极，浑身上下都湿透了，幸好现在不是冬天，否则以他的身体，非得冻出个好歹。“大少爷，大少爷，您这是怎么了！”辛小虎也赶了过来，脱掉自己外衣就要给宋雪衣披上。宋雪衣抗拒的让开，蹲下身子使自己的身高和站着的灵鸠持平，甚至还矮一点，“鸠儿，对不起。”灵鸠：“……”宋雪衣低声道：“我不知道你就是卿家的那只鸠儿，如果我知道，定不会放你走。”灵鸠：“……你才卿家的那只鸠儿，我是灵鸠，不是谁家的。”“嗯，鸠儿就是鸠儿，独一无二。”宋雪衣低笑出来，随即又咳嗽两声，昂头望着灵鸠，“鸠儿说过的话，可还算数？”“什么话？”灵鸠听到他咳嗽，眉梢就抖了抖，伸手取了辛小虎脱的衣服往他身上披。这一回宋雪衣没有躲避，看得辛小虎一阵目瞪口呆。宋雪衣道：“你说会在我身边养好我的病，保护我。”周围看客闻言后表情一阵扭曲，你一个十几岁的人了，还要个六、七岁的小女孩保护，亏你还好意思说出来。灵鸠却问道：“你需要吗。”“需要，很需要。”宋雪衣毫不犹豫的回答。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/qingbenheimengzhiyaofeilaixi/6.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 006 Chasing in the Rain Although Aunt Xin wanted to stay, Lingjiu decided to leave. After staying for lunch, Aunt Xin specifically asked her nephew to escort Lingjiu away. Lingjiu was carrying a package that was half her size on her shoulders. As she walked, she saw Xin Xiaohu worried. He wanted to ask her to carry it for him several times, but was defeated by Lingjiu's eyes. He thought aggrievedly: I really don't want to snatch the snacks in your package. What are you doing with those anti-thief eyes? \"Xiaojiu, it's actually good to stay in the Song family.\" Xin Xiaohu has not forgotten the task assigned to him by his aunt, and is still trying to persuade him. Lingjiu nodded, and before Xin Xiaohu was happy, he said: \"It's good, but they don't need me.\" Xin Xiaohu wanted to think about why he didn't need me, but when he looked back and thought about the many girls in the Song family, there was really no shortage of Lingjiu. The two of them walked out of the Song family's door together. Xin Xiaohu did not persuade Lingjiu to stay, and finally gave up. He asked her where she was going and planned to send her there. Lingjiu stood outside the gate of the Song family, looking up at a strange place. She suddenly felt at a loss for a moment. This was not the world she was familiar with. From the moment she opened her eyes again, except for staying at Qing's house for less than half a day, she had been at Song's house since then. Lingjiu looked back at the door of the Song family. When Xin Xiaohu thought she was planning to go back, she calmly withdrew her gaze and asked Xin Xiaohu, \"Can I buy a house for one hundred taels? It doesn't matter if the location is desolate, as long as it's comfortable to live in.\" Xin Xiaohu looked at Lingjiu in surprise. Is she planning to buy a house to live by herself? Doesn't it matter if the location is a little desolate? This is too bold! \"Well, I have a bungalow in the north of the city. The location is not good, but the layout is okay. If Xiaojiu doesn't mind, you can stay there for free.\" \"Thank you.\" Lingjiu nodded and agreed. \"...No need.\" Xin Xiaohu was about to cry but had no tears. Why do I still feel guilty despite working so hard? Let's say that when the two of them were walking slowly to the north of the city, Song Xueyi, who was at the Song family at this time, was also anxious. During the day, he held an oil-paper umbrella and went to the river. It was not surprising that he didn't see the girl there. He stood alone for half an hour in silence. Finally, he smiled and glanced at the strange and easy-to-understand funny patterns carved on the tree trunks before leaving. After leaving the river and returning to his residence, he asked his servants to check for Lingjiu's existence. Unexpectedly, he couldn't find her after searching for a long time. In Lanyuan. \"Madam, the eldest young master is making a lot of noise there. He says he is looking for a child.\" Su Luo said to Sun Gulan. Sun Gulan thought about it in her mind and said to Su Luo: \"Send someone over to ask who Xue Yi wants to find, and let everyone find it together.\" Su Luo responded and left to give orders. After a while, Su Luo led people to the Xueyuan where Song Xueyi lived, and met Song Xueyi through the report. For the first time, he could clearly see the emotions of the young master he had seen since childhood. \"Young Master, Madam asked me to ask who the person you are looking for is. It will be faster with my help.\" Su Luo said cautiously. \"Jiu'er.\" Song Xueyi said softly. Su Luo didn't understand and looked hesitant. Song Xueyi looked up. The red-striped mask looked strange and cold in the sunset and rain, but his voice was clear and soft, and could not be clearer. \"Lingjiu, her name is Baili Lingjiu. She should be about seven years old. She is cute and always wears blue clothes.\" When Su Luo heard the name, he felt something was wrong. The further back he went, the more inexplicable he felt. Her expression also showed her thoughts. Song Xueyi moved her head slightly, and noticed something strange about Su Luo, and asked, \"What do you know?\" Su Luo heard the urgency in his tone, and whispered: \"According to what the young master said, he is very similar to someone I know.\" He glanced at Song Xueyi, lowered his head again and said in embarrassment: \"The name of the daughter sent from Qing's family more than two months ago is Qing. Lingjiu, seven years old, has a pretty and cute appearance, and her pretty eyes are the most attractive. She has been studying with Aunt Xin before, and the clothes she was given were blue. \"Song Xueyi stood up, \"Where is she?\" Su Luo was startled by his sudden intense emotion, and said: \"Because the eldest young master has said to send her away. So...\" Song Xueyi tightened her palms, \"Where did she send her?\" Su Luo lowered her head, \"No, Madam gave her two choices, one is to stay in the Song family as a maid, and the other is to return her deed of betrayal and one hundred taels of silver...\" As she was talking, another nanny in blue walked in from outside and said, \"Suluo, please let me be nice. Look, Xiaojiu's matter has been settled, but the child is so stubborn at such a young age that she actually chose the deed of betrayal and the banknote and left... She is so young, I am not at ease at all. Why don't you go talk to the eldest lady and ask her to wait for two more days while I find a way to persuade you?\" This grandma is the one who has taught Lingjiu for more than two months. \"Master! Master! Umbrella -!\" The exclamation suddenly came to mind, attracting the attention of Su Luo and Aunt Xin. Before they could react, they saw the eldest young master, who had always been frail and sick, running outside in the heavy rain. \"What, what's going on?\" Grandma Xin was stunned. \"Ask me, I'll ask who to go to.\" Su Luo unknowingly walked to Nanny Xin and sighed: \"Anyway, it has something to do with that little dove.\" It gets dark quickly in the afternoon, especially when it rains. Lingjiu and Xin Xiaohu were sitting in a teahouse, looking at the pouring rain outside. Xin Xiaohu said, \"It seems you can't leave today even if you want to.\" Lingjiu pursed her lips, noncommittal. \"Hey, did you know? There is a madman on the street. He is running around outside without an umbrella on a heavy rainy day.\" Another person who went into the teahouse to take shelter from the rain was chatting with his friends about interesting things. \"Oh, the one you're talking about, I saw it too. Is it a young man wearing a strange mask and white clothes, who looks weak and weak?\" \"Yes, that's right, that's the one. Could it be a young man from some family who went crazy reading a book? That mask is quite scary, white and red...\" \"Listen to him.", "title_en": "Chapter 6"}